            "         Dataset construction process for MuSR.  First, we generate gold facts that are used to deduce the correct answer (the murderer in this case).  Then, using an LLM, we create a reasoning tree leading to those deductions from facts in a story combined with commonsense.  Finally, we iteratively generate a narrative one chunk at a time using the facts generated in step 2, validating the generations for fact consistency and recall. \n",
